{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kero Quest 64 is a <i>Collectathon 3D Platformer</i> inspired by other games in the genre, especially those from the late 90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take control of Kero, a blue frog seeking to stop a prince from spreading evil <strong>Shards</strong> across the <i>Kingdom of Bunnabaria</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/extras/415206c6993445c281b86542114f39a6.poster.avif?t=1765471442\" width=982 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/extras/415206c6993445c281b86542114f39a6.webm?t=1765471442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/extras/415206c6993445c281b86542114f39a6.mp4?t=1765471442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Big World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you must find your way through <strong>20+ Open Levels</strong>, each with its own Retro 3D aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your quest to gain <strong>Shards</strong>, you will collect various things such as <strong>Gold Coins</strong> and <strong>Costumes</strong> for Kero to wear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/extras/6f1d8561611e8e992c8e859b49787277.poster.avif?t=1765471442\" width=982 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/extras/6f1d8561611e8e992c8e859b49787277.webm?t=1765471442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/extras/6f1d8561611e8e992c8e859b49787277.mp4?t=1765471442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls with some advanced movement options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, light-hearted story that can be enjoyed by anyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro graphics inspired by the late 90s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>20</strong> levels to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of things to collect in every level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional content such as <strong>Costumes</strong> to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/extras/7a9a07e86a3832ecad392c9f0d7e59e5.poster.avif?t=1765471442\" width=982 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/extras/7a9a07e86a3832ecad392c9f0d7e59e5.webm?t=1765471442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/extras/7a9a07e86a3832ecad392c9f0d7e59e5.mp4?t=1765471442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411900?t=1765471442","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/b4130100bd7023b65f05b7658533e8845e34d58a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765471442","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/df40d65c5ba416a9e5b644d06bf824eb8198fcb1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765471442","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/df40d65c5ba416a9e5b644d06bf824eb8198fcb1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765471442","categories":[{"d